message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software release and the associated article."
title: "HAI_LANGUAGE: Hierarchical active inference for language, reading, and eye movements"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-02"
license: GPL-1.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/donnarumma/HAI_LANGUAGE"
url: "https://github.com/donnarumma/HAI_LANGUAGE"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB implementation of a hierarchical active inference model of language,
  reading, and eye movements. The software combines hierarchical generative
  models with large-language-model predictions and includes simulations of
  known and novel word recognition, saccades, and dyslexic reading.
